@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam stateFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false

state "已报名" as Registered
state "候补中" as Waitlisted
state "已签到" as CheckedIn
state "已取消" as Cancelled
state "缺席" as Absent
state "活动取消" as EventCancelled
state "候补失效" as Expired

[*] --> Registered : 报名成功 / 占用名额
[*] --> Waitlisted : 满额登记候补 / 不占名额
Waitlisted --> Registered : 报名截止前递补 / 发放凭证
Waitlisted --> Expired : 报名截止 / 队列停止
Registered --> CheckedIn : 核验通过 / 唯一签到
Registered --> Cancelled : 取消报名 / 释放名额
Registered --> Absent : 场次结束未签到
Registered --> EventCancelled : 活动取消 / 未签到记录
CheckedIn --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Absent --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
EventCancelled --> [*]

note right of CheckedIn
  已签到记录不因活动取消
  回退，历史与日志保留（REQ-018）。
end note
note bottom of Cancelled
  禁止：候补中→已签到、
  已取消→已签到、已签到→已取消。
  截止后取消不触发递补（REQ-011/015）。
end note
@enduml
